{"seq":3,"slug":"reinsurance-pricing","title":"再保险定价","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/insurance-economics/pricing/reinsurance-pricing","wordCount":2074,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"再保险定价\">再保险定价</h1><p>再保险是&quot;保险公司的保险&quot;——当原保险公司（分出公司/cedant）面临的风险超出其风险承受能力或资本约束时，通过再保险合同将部分风险转移给再保险公司。再保险定价的核心挑战在于：数据更加稀疏（大额损失本身就是低频事件）、合同结构更加复杂（分层、复效、利润分享等条款）、信息不对称更加突出（分出公司比再保险公司更了解自己的业务）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>再保险是&quot;保险公司的保险&quot;，其定价困难源于三个结构性事实：大额损失本身低频导致数据稀疏、合同结构复杂（分层、复效、利润分享）、以及分出公司比再保险公司更了解自身业务的信息不对称。合同分为<strong>比例再保险</strong>（按固定比例分摊保费与赔付，基于原始组合损失率）与<strong>非比例再保险</strong>（超过阈值的损失由再保险人承担，基于层的期望损失加加载）两大类。非比例层的定价工具随数据充足度递进：<strong>Burning Cost</strong> 用历史层内赔付经验加趋势调整，<strong>暴露定价</strong>用增限损失因子在无历史数据时推算，<strong>巨灾模型</strong>则以物理模拟替代历史经验。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>表达式 / 角色</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>比例再保险</td>\n<td>固定比例分摊</td>\n<td>稳定业务、容量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>非比例再保险</td>\n<td>层 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> xs <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>，层内损失</td>\n<td>巨灾、尾部风险</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Burning Cost</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">‾</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>t</mi></msub><msub><mtext>Ceded Loss</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>t</mi></msub><msub><mtext>Subject Premium</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\overline{BC}=\\frac{\\sum_t \\text{Ceded Loss}_t}{\\sum_t \\text{Subject Premium}_t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord overline\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8833em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8033em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"overline-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.63em;vertical-align:-0.57em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.06em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op mtight\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1179em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.1786em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3214em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Subject Premium</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1735em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2341em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2659em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.535em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op mtight\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1179em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.1786em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3214em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Ceded Loss</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2963em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.57em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>有历史经验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>暴露定价</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G(R+L)-G(R)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>历史数据不足</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>巨灾模型</td>\n<td>OEP/AEP/AAL</td>\n<td>百年一遇事件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"再保险的经济功能\">再保险的经济功能</h2><p>再保险解决的不是个体被保险人的风险转移需求，而是保险公司层面的四个核心问题：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>容量扩展</strong>：允许保险公司承保超过自身资本能力的大额风险</li>\n<li><strong>波动平滑</strong>：将巨灾年份的峰值赔付转移出去，稳定财务报表</li>\n<li><strong>资本效率</strong>：再保险在偿付能力计算中抵减所需资本，释放承保能力</li>\n<li><strong>信息与专业知识</strong>：再保险公司通过跨市场经验提供核保建议和风险工程服务</li>\n</ol>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 原保险层&#10;        A[投保人] --&gt;|保费| B[原保险公司]&#10;        B --&gt;|赔付| A&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 再保险层&#10;        B --&gt;|再保险保费| C[再保险公司]&#10;        C --&gt;|再保险赔付| B&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 转分保层&#10;        C --&gt;|转分保费| D[转再保险公司]&#10;        D --&gt;|转再赔付| C&#10;    end&#10;    B --&gt;|巨灾债券| E[资本市场投资者]\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 原保险层\n        A[投保人] --&gt;|保费| B[原保险公司]\n        B --&gt;|赔付| A\n    end\n    subgraph 再保险层\n        B --&gt;|再保险保费| C[再保险公司]\n        C --&gt;|再保险赔付| B\n    end\n    subgraph 转分保层\n        C --&gt;|转分保费| D[转再保险公司]\n        D --&gt;|转再赔付| C\n    end\n    B --&gt;|巨灾债券| E[资本市场投资者]</pre><h2 id=\"再保险合同结构\">再保险合同结构</h2><p>再保险合同的两大基本类别决定了定价方法的选择：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类别</th>\n<th>结构</th>\n<th>定价逻辑</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>比例再保险（Proportional）</strong></td>\n<td>按固定比例分摊保费与赔付</td>\n<td>基于原始组合的损失率</td>\n<td>稳定业务、容量需求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成数再保险（Quota Share）</td>\n<td>固定比例（如 30%）分出</td>\n<td>佣金率 vs 预期损失率</td>\n<td>新业务、资本释放</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>溢额再保险（Surplus）</td>\n<td>超过自留额部分按比例分出</td>\n<td>同上但加权于大额保单</td>\n<td>控制单一风险暴露</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>非比例再保险（Non-Proportional）</strong></td>\n<td>超过阈值的损失由再保险承担</td>\n<td>层的期望损失 + 加载</td>\n<td>巨灾保护、尾部风险</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>每风险超赔（Per Risk XL）</td>\n<td>单一风险超过自留额</td>\n<td>Burning cost + 趋势调整</td>\n<td>大额个体损失</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>每事件超赔（Per Event XL）</td>\n<td>单一事件累计超过自留额</td>\n<td>巨灾模型模拟</td>\n<td>自然灾害、累积事件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>止损超赔（Stop Loss）</td>\n<td>年度总赔付超过阈值</td>\n<td>总赔付分布尾部概率</td>\n<td>整体波动保护</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"burning-cost-方法\">Burning Cost 方法</h2><p>Burning cost 是非比例再保险定价最经典、使用最广泛的经验定价方法。核心思想：观察再保险层在历史年度中实际&quot;燃烧&quot;了多少（层内赔付占标的保费的比率），调整趋势后投射到未来。</p>\n<p>对于层 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> xs <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>（限额 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>，自留额 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>），历史年度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 的分入损失为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>Ceded Loss</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></munderover><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>R</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Ceded Loss}_t = \\sum_{i=1}^{n_t} \\min(\\max(x_i - R, 0), L)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Ceded Loss</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9402em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6625em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3111em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2963em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>Burning cost 费率为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mtext>Ceded Loss</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub><msub><mtext>Subject Premium</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">BC_t = \\frac{\\text{Ceded Loss}_t}{\\text{Subject Premium}_t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3016em;vertical-align:-0.9301em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Subject Premium</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Ceded Loss</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9301em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>加权平均 burning cost：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">‾</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>t</mi></munder><msub><mtext>Ceded Loss</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>t</mi></munder><msub><mtext>Subject Premium</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\overline{BC} = \\frac{\\sum_t \\text{Ceded Loss}_t}{\\sum_t \\text{Subject Premium}_t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord overline\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8833em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8033em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"overline-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4254em;vertical-align:-0.9857em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4397em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1308em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Subject Premium</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6897em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1308em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Ceded Loss</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9857em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>在使用前必须对历史损失进行两项调整：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>损失发展</strong>（Development）：大额损失报告晚、结案慢，需乘以发展因子调整到最终值</li>\n<li><strong>趋势调整</strong>（Trending）：将历史损失调整到当前成本水平（通胀、医疗费用上涨等）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"暴露定价法\">暴露定价法</h2><p>当历史数据不足（新险种、高层超赔）时，暴露定价法（Exposure Rating）利用原始保单组合的暴露特征来推算层的期望损失，而不依赖实际历史赔付经验。</p>\n<p>核心工具是<strong>增限损失因子</strong>（Increased Limits Factors, ILF）和 <strong>Swiss Re 曲线</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Layer Expected Loss</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>Ground-up Loss</mtext><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Layer Expected Loss} = \\text{Ground-up Loss} \\times [G(R+L) - G(R)]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Layer Expected Loss</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Ground-up Loss</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G(\\cdot)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">⋅</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是归一化的损失分布函数（通常是经验或参数形式）。</p>\n<p>暴露定价的优势在于不需要再保险层的实际历史损失数据——只要知道原始组合的暴露分布即可。但其准确性高度依赖于所使用的损失分布假设。</p>\n<h2 id=\"巨灾模型定价\">巨灾模型定价</h2><p>对于巨灾超赔（CatXL），传统经验方法几乎不可用——百年一遇的事件在 5-10 年的观察期内可能从未发生。巨灾模型（如 RMS、AIR、CoreLogic）通过模拟大量物理场景来生成事件损失分布。</p>\n<p>巨灾模型的四个模块：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>危害模块（Hazard）</strong>：模拟自然灾害的物理特征（风速场、地震烈度、洪水深度）</li>\n<li><strong>脆弱性模块（Vulnerability）</strong>：给定危害强度，估计建筑物的损坏程度</li>\n<li><strong>暴露模块（Exposure）</strong>：描述保险组合的地理分布、建筑类型和保额</li>\n<li><strong>金融模块（Financial）</strong>：将物理损害转化为保险赔付（应用免赔额、限额、再保险结构）</li>\n</ol>\n<p>模型输出的关键指标：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>OEP</strong>（Occurrence Exceedance Probability）：单一事件损失超过阈值的概率</li>\n<li><strong>AEP</strong>（Aggregate Exceedance Probability）：年度总损失超过阈值的概率</li>\n<li><strong>AAL</strong>（Average Annual Loss）：年度平均期望损失</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"再保险定价中的信息不对称\">再保险定价中的信息不对称</h2><p>再保险市场面临特殊的逆向选择问题：分出公司比再保险公司更了解自己组合的风险质量。这表现为：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>选择性分出</strong>：保险公司倾向于将质量较差的业务分出、保留质量较好的业务</li>\n<li><strong>核保信息不对称</strong>：分出公司在核保过程中获得的详细风险信息不一定完整传递给再保险公司</li>\n<li><strong>损失信息延迟</strong>：分出公司可能先于再保险公司知晓损失发展的不利趋势</li>\n</ul>\n<p>再保险公司应对这些问题的方法包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>要求详细的组合数据和核保标准披露</li>\n<li>合同中的利润分享/滑动佣金条款（align incentives）</li>\n<li>长期合作关系建立声誉约束</li>\n<li>同比例共保（再保险公司与分出公司共担底层风险）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"替代风险转移与巨灾债券\">替代风险转移与巨灾债券</h2><p>传统再保险的替代品——巨灾债券（Cat Bond）将保险风险直接证券化到资本市场：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Cat Bond Spread</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mtext>risk premium</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mtext>expense loading</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Cat Bond Spread} = E[L] \\times (1 + \\text{risk premium}) + \\text{expense loading}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Cat Bond Spread</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">risk premium</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">expense loading</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>2025 年全球巨灾债券未到期余额超过 470 亿美元。其定价与传统再保险的区别：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>价格由资本市场供求决定，而非精算纯粹的期望损失加载</li>\n<li>在&quot;硬市场&quot;（再保险产能紧张）时巨灾债券溢价可能低于传统再保险</li>\n<li>触发机制可以是参数式（指数触发）或赔付式（indemnity trigger），影响基差风险</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>再保险解决保险公司的容量、波动、资本和信息四大需求</li>\n<li>Burning cost 是非比例再保险最核心的经验定价方法</li>\n<li>暴露定价填补了历史数据不足时的定价空白</li>\n<li>巨灾模型通过物理模拟替代了历史经验的局限</li>\n<li>再保险市场的信息不对称需要合同设计与长期关系来缓解</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"loss-distribution-models\">损失分布模型</a>：再保险定价中尾部分布（GPD、帕累托）选择的技术细节</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../financial-risk-management/frontiers/climate-esg-risk\">气候与 ESG 风险</a>：气候变化如何推动巨灾再保险定价的结构性上升</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"再保险定价","id":"再保险定价"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"再保险的经济功能","id":"再保险的经济功能"},{"level":2,"text":"再保险合同结构","id":"再保险合同结构"},{"level":2,"text":"Burning Cost 方法","id":"burning-cost-方法"},{"level":2,"text":"暴露定价法","id":"暴露定价法"},{"level":2,"text":"巨灾模型定价","id":"巨灾模型定价"},{"level":2,"text":"再保险定价中的信息不对称","id":"再保险定价中的信息不对称"},{"level":2,"text":"替代风险转移与巨灾债券","id":"替代风险转移与巨灾债券"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"损失分布模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/insurance-economics/pricing/loss-distribution-models"},"next":{"title":"保险市场结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/insurance-economics/markets/insurance-market-structure"}}